{"attachments":[{"id":"att-1791720688066-f5f7257dec83175a","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1791720688066-f5f7257dec83175a-259118-edited.webp","sha256":"ce7fb2234a12928c67ed08ccf4530eda79e1c532d804d7b0c21299c00047fca6"},{"id":"att-1791720700160-5b42eaa238c79ad4","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1791720700160-5b42eaa238c79ad4-259120-edited.webp","sha256":"94d6d33642d1d1b649fae1de5d76afbbb89d65ca96d1fc198e796860eeab8d1e"},{"id":"att-1791720707663-dd092ecee8569b8f","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1791720707663-dd092ecee8569b8f-259119-edited.webp","sha256":"f497ae71ca1704be50765dce3e0fbd1856c519311e9b53b1eae04365e5266dbe"}],"body":"[글로리데이즈](https://map.naver.com/p?c=127.348137,36.361338,16,0,0,0,dh)\n\n교회 끝나구 집 올때마다 뿌실 예정.\n여긴 아이스티가 매우 맛있음\n![에그타르트](layall-attachment:att-1791720688066-f5f7257dec83175a)\n평범. 또먹진 않을듯. 에그스러운 맛이 강함.\n\n![초코타르트](layall-attachment:att-1791720707663-dd092ecee8569b8f) ![생크림과 조합 돌았](layall-attachment:att-1791720700160-5b42eaa238c79ad4)\n\n개맛있음. 지금까지 먹은 초코타르트 중 짱.\n브라우니스러운 초코와 생크림, 하단의 타르트가 너무 잘 어울림. \n청포도도 황홀하다..","folderId":"folder-8d568d63b41c9c8f","format":"layall-note","highlights":[],"noteId":"note-63af353b-1713-4b01-a342-3eb582df6daa","pageId":"page-1791719159475-2167ed12a1558","permalink":"post-23c354cda433bb63de6699862f0afa87","postId":"post-23c354cda433bb63de6699862f0afa87","publishOptions":{"folderId":"folder-8d568d63b41c9c8f","includeAttachments":true,"includeHighlights":true,"includeSummaries":true,"includeTags":true,"includeTasks":true},"revision":1,"sourceUpdatedAt":1791732250828,"summaries":[],"tags":[],"tasks":[],"title":"[음식] 글로리데이즈","version":1}